/E (Under the Shift tab, managers can access a comprehensive overview of live data for the day, enabling informed decision-making at a glance. This feature allows them to monitor crucial metrics such as the number of covers that have come in versus those still expected, current daily sales alongside forecasted figures, and the per person average \(PPA\) compared to the targeted PPA. Additionally, managers can evaluate Covers Per Labour Hour \(CPLH\) and Sales Per Labour Hour \(SPLH\) against their respective targets, while also reviewing the blended wage that reflects the average hourly rate of the staff on duty. With this instant snapshot of performance data, managers gain valuable insights into the business's standing and can proactively address any discrepancies, ensuring they operate with real numbers rather than relying on instinct alone. Adopting a data-driven approach enhances the alignment of daily operations with forecasts, while simultaneously refining efforts to meet key performance indicators effectively.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
