/E (The variance tab serves as a vital tool for management by providing a clear comparison between theoretical or baseline expectations and actual performance across key performance indicators \(KPIs\). This comparison highlights the variance, which represents the gap between what should have happened and what actually occurred. By delving into these variances, management can uncover opportunities for improvement, as each discrepancy signals a potential area for corrective action. Understanding this gap is crucial, as it not only indicates where things may have gone awry but also invites teams to explore the underlying factors contributing to the performance shift.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
144 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
