/P 94 0 R
/E (The consequences of inadequate training can be detrimental, with many establishments rely on the informal transfer of knowledge from one employee to another, which may not always be comprehensive or accurate. This reliance can result in poorly trained employees who lack the essential information and skills required for their roles, ultimately impacting the overall performance of the restaurant. Acknowledging this challenge, we have integrated an LMS into our app, providing staff with easy access to training materials, handbooks, and assessments. As employees engage with this content, they receive scores reflecting their understanding and retention of the material relevant to their position. Managers can effortlessly track the progress of each team member within the same app they use to monitor key performance indicators \(KPIs\), ensuring that training and operational efficiency go hand-in-hand.)
