310 0 obj
<<
/Title (Additionally, managers have the flexibility to override these targets once, should unique circumstances arise that could distort normal performance metrics, such as a sudden change in market conditions or unforeseen operational challenges. This singular adjustment allows for necessary flexibility while maintaining the integrity of the data. By restricting the number of alterations, the system fosters a more realistic representation of results, minimizing the potential for skewed data that could lead to misguided decisions. This balance of adaptability and consistency ensures that your team can respond effectively to emerging challenges while remaining grounded in reliable, actionable insights.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 377 0 R
/Next 171 0 R
