/Title (At the bottom of the weekly plan, users can view the cumulative total for the week, including real-time performance against forecasts. This feature offers insights into how the current week is progressing compared to projections and indicates what sales figures could look like if the current trajectory continues. Furthermore, users can navigate to a dedicated tab showcasing historical data from previous weeks, enabling them to identify patterns and make informed adjustments to their strategies as necessary.)
