/Title (PLAN Under the "Plan" tab, users can access their comprehensive weekly plan, which provides a detailed forecast for each day of the week. These forecasts are meticulously crafted by analyzing 60 days of data from the Point of Sale \(POS\) system, while also considering various factors that may impact guest covers, such as existing reservations. The forecasting tool goes beyond traditional methods by not only assessing historical data but also by taking into account current trends and expected guest attendance. By calculating the Per Person Average \(PPA\) from the past two months and pairing it with anticipated guest numbers, the system generates accurate sales forecasts. Additionally, the start day of the week is customizable, allowing clients to tailor their planning based on what best fits their operational rhythms and preferences.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 582 0 R
/Next 528 0 R
>>
endobj
